[00:19.95] My last guilt-themed solicitation
[00:24.50] Delivered slowly in hesitation,
[00:29.40] It could not soothe me, could not seduce me
[00:34.11] Into repainting these strokes so loosely.
[00:39.12] How I remember my ex-blue t-shirt.
[00:44.23] Where the hole in it fell...
[00:49.29] Plain-dressed, wilting and wired,
[00:51.58] You were the picture of health.
[01:15.77] Wine glass drowning, postponed narration
[01:20.15] Make every new drag no mere frustration.
[01:24.90] I fell in debt to those country crooners
[01:29.83] Mourning lost love like Spanish funerals.
[01:34.64] Dye the grey hair you grew in secret
[01:39.56] To a root-colored shell.
[01:44.59] Frozen mid-sentenced smile,
[01:46.68] You were the picture of health.
[01:52.00] No prognosis implied
[01:54.09] You were the picture of health.
[01:59.46] Plain-dressed, wilting and wired,
[02:01.44] You were the picture of health.
